[[0,1175730,0,17,0,17,"2016-07-17T11:08:02","Cannonfodder","",[],"","Pink floyd- welcome to the machine","http://youtu.be/lt-udg9zQSE","music"],[1,5822198,0,4,0,4,"2016-07-17T13:06:13","dabork","",[],"<p>More relevant now than it ever was, and all the more depressing.<br />\nSuch a solid fucking album even if it's only like 5 songs (if you don't count SOYCD as more than one song).<br />\nEverybody's always jacking off DSOTM but this and Animals were always my favorite. </p>"],[2,5822228,5822198,3,0,3,"2016-07-17T13:14:44","Cannonfodder","",[],"<p>Thank you for your enthusiasm. Welcome to the machine has always scared the shit out of me, its an introduction to the new world. The first time i heard shine on i was on acid and my best friend thought it was appropriate </p>"],[3,5822381,5822228,2,0,2,"2016-07-17T13:50:06","dabork","",[],"<p>No problem, I'm a pretty huge Floyd fan and this is easily one of my top 5. It really is scary and this whole album has sent chills up my spine both on and off psychedelics.</p>\n<p>Shine on gets a little to intense for me sometimes if I'm tripping though, it just goes on forever and as soon as you think it's over it's not. </p>"],[3,5822439,5822228,1,0,1,"2016-07-17T14:00:37","watitdew","",[],"<p>Don't drop acid and listen to 'Animals'.</p>\n<p>Just saying.</p>"],[4,5823999,5822439,1,0,1,"2016-07-17T20:07:11","bm2112","",[],"<p>Why? I've done so and found it very enjoyable. It's one of my all-time favorite albums</p>"],[5,5824004,5823999,1,0,1,"2016-07-17T20:07:46","watitdew","",[],"<p>Dogs</p>"],[1,5845211,0,0,0,0,"2016-07-20T05:20:53","ElectricCanabull","",[],"<p>Where have you been?</p>"],[1,5845222,0,0,0,0,"2016-07-20T05:22:55","ElectricCanabull","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3-oJt_5JvV4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3-oJt_5JvV4</a></p>"]]
